# Claude Code workspace (`.claude/`)

**Index:** `.claude/README.md` and `.claude/tool-registry.md`

## Layer separation

- **Codebase docs** → `CLAUDE.md` files (not here)
- **Workflows** → `.claude/commands/` (slash commands), `.claude/agents/`, `.claude/skills/`

## Useful for any frontend work

Commands: `pragmatic-code-review`, `design-review`, `security-review`, `code-quality`  
Skills: `frontend-design`, `systematic-debugging`, `testing-patterns`

## Hooks (`.claude/settings.json`)

- `protect-main.sh` — blocks commits to main
- `format-on-save.sh` — formats on Write/Edit

Cursor does not run Claude hooks automatically; follow the same conventions manually.
